{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "updated": "2026-10-04",
  "note": "Every source below was probed against the live server, and every file's version was read from the genuine upstream file by the extension's own parser. 'replace' entries have a verified, downloadable BUILT file. 'report-only' entries are published as .dtx sources only (or have been superseded by a differently named file), so no client can produce a correct replacement without running LaTeX -- for those we detect and report drift rather than silently writing a wrong file. CTAN's ctan.org/tex-archive path is a round-robin redirector and individual mirrors intermittently return 403 pages or truncated files, so raw sources carry explicit mirror fallbacks and every downloaded class is checked with expectName before it can be written to a project. versionFrom 'none' marks a file whose only version-shaped text is not its own version (a BibTeX lineage number, the first entry of a changelog); those are compared by content alone, because a wrong version would report a stale file as current.",
  "sources": {
    "acm-primary-zip": {
      "kind": "zip",
      "url": "https://portalparts.acm.org/hippo/latex_templates/acmart-primary.zip",
      "sizeNote": "~15 MB, downloaded once per browser session and cached",
      "comment": "ACM's official template archive, linked from acm.org/publications/proceedings-template. This is the ONLY published source of a compiled acmart.cls -- CTAN and github.com/borisveytsman/acmart both ship acmart.dtx sources only, there is no TDS zip and no GitHub release asset. Verified to contain acmart.cls v2.20 (2026/08/16), matching CTAN's latest."
    }
  },
